{
 "Фигура. Внешний прямоугольник ADEH": "<figure class='st'><svg viewBox='0 0 380 292' width='100%' role='img' aria-label='Рамка из пяти прямоугольников: две боковые колонны и три этажа между ними'><rect x='70' y='25' width='230' height='230' fill='none' stroke='#cfdae6' stroke-width='2'/><g stroke='#cfdae6' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='5 4'><line x1='130' y1='25' x2='130' y2='255'/><line x1='240' y1='25' x2='240' y2='255'/><line x1='130' y1='225' x2='240' y2='225'/><line x1='130' y1='55' x2='240' y2='55'/></g><rect x='130' y='55' width='110' height='170' fill='#f0a83c' fill-opacity='.10' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='2'/><g fill='#e8eef6' font-size='14' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor='middle'><text x='62' y='272'>A</text><text x='130' y='272'>B</text><text x='240' y='272'>C</text><text x='308' y='272'>D</text><text x='62' y='18'>H</text><text x='130' y='18'>G</text><text x='240' y='18'>F</text><text x='308' y='18'>E</text></g><g fill='#e8eef6' font-size='12.5' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor='middle'><text x='142' y='216'>M</text><text x='228' y='216'>P</text><text x='142' y='70'>S</text><text x='228' y='70'>R</text></g><g fill='#f0a83c' font-size='13.5' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor='middle'><text x='100' y='246'>a</text><text x='185' y='246'>w</text><text x='270' y='246'>a</text><text x='185' y='148'>v − 2m</text></g><g stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.5'><line x1='316' y1='225' x2='316' y2='255'/><line x1='311' y1='225' x2='321' y2='225'/><line x1='311' y1='255' x2='321' y2='255'/></g><text x='330' y='245' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='13.5' font-family='sans-serif'>m</text><g stroke='#93a1b1' stroke-width='1'><line x1='52' y1='25' x2='52' y2='255'/><line x1='47' y1='25' x2='57' y2='25'/><line x1='47' y1='255' x2='57' y2='255'/></g><text x='36' y='145' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='13.5' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor='middle'>v</text></svg><figcaption>Перемычки равны, поэтому окно ниже фигуры ровно на две их высоты: пометка «BCPM и SRFG равны» и есть недостающая строка системы.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Фигура. Справа — прямоугольная часть в два этажа": "<figure class='st'><svg viewBox='0 0 420 242' width='100%' role='img' aria-label='Прямоугольная часть в два этажа и треугольник T, приклеенный к её левой стороне'><path d='M84 110 L150 40 L370 40 L370 180 L150 180 Z' fill='none' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='2.5'/><line x1='150' y1='40' x2='150' y2='180' stroke='#f2686c' stroke-width='2' stroke-dasharray='6 5'/><g stroke='#cfdae6' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='5 4'><line x1='150' y1='96' x2='370' y2='96'/><line x1='246' y1='40' x2='246' y2='96'/><line x1='194' y1='96' x2='194' y2='180'/><line x1='238' y1='96' x2='238' y2='180'/><line x1='282' y1='96' x2='282' y2='180'/><line x1='326' y1='96' x2='326' y2='180'/></g><g fill='#e8eef6' font-size='15' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor='middle'><text x='114' y='116'>T</text><text x='198' y='74'>A</text><text x='308' y='74'>B</text></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='12' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor='middle'><text x='172' y='144'>R</text><text x='216' y='144'>R</text><text x='260' y='144'>R</text><text x='304' y='144'>R</text><text x='348' y='144'>R</text></g><g stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.5'><line x1='388' y1='40' x2='388' y2='180'/><line x1='383' y1='40' x2='393' y2='40'/><line x1='383' y1='180' x2='393' y2='180'/></g><text x='398' y='114' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='13.5' font-family='sans-serif'>5k</text><g stroke='#93a1b1' stroke-width='1'><line x1='150' y1='198' x2='370' y2='198'/><line x1='150' y1='193' x2='150' y2='203'/><line x1='370' y1='193' x2='370' y2='203'/></g><text x='260' y='215' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='13.5' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor='middle'>x + y</text><text x='210' y='234' fill='#f2686c' font-size='13' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor='middle'>основание T — вся левая стена, в контур фигуры оно не входит</text></svg><figcaption>Правая стена фигуры такой же высоты, что и основание T, а бока T идут прямо по контуру — поэтому разность контуров уносит всё неизвестное разом.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Фигура. На земле — квадрат BCJI": "<figure class='st'><svg viewBox='0 0 420 292' width='100%' role='img' aria-label='Домик: квадрат из трёх равных полос R, надстройка, крыша и правый прямоугольник'><path d='M94 252 L150 60 L210 20 L270 60 L326 60 L326 252 Z' fill='none' stroke='#cfdae6' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='94' y1='252' x2='150' y2='60' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='3'/><g stroke='#f2686c' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-dasharray='6 5'><line x1='150' y1='60' x2='150' y2='252'/><line x1='270' y1='60' x2='270' y2='252'/><line x1='150' y1='132' x2='270' y2='132'/><line x1='150' y1='60' x2='270' y2='60'/></g><g stroke='#cfdae6' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='5 4'><line x1='190' y1='132' x2='190' y2='252'/><line x1='230' y1='132' x2='230' y2='252'/></g><g fill='#e8eef6' font-size='13.5' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor='middle'><text x='210' y='13'>G</text><text x='138' y='55'>H</text><text x='280' y='55'>F</text><text x='336' y='55'>E</text><text x='138' y='142'>I</text><text x='280' y='142'>J</text><text x='86' y='268'>A</text><text x='148' y='268'>B</text><text x='270' y='268'>C</text><text x='334' y='268'>D</text></g><text x='106' y='152' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='15' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor='middle'>n</text><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='12.5' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor='middle'><text x='170' y='196'>R</text><text x='210' y='196'>R</text><text x='250' y='196'>R</text></g><text x='210' y='286' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='13' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor='middle'>стены B→I→H и C→J→F идут сквозь оба этажа</text></svg><figcaption>Наклонную AH не измеряют: в контуре ACFH все остальные куски уже известны, и она остаётся в нём единственной неизвестной.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Заметь главное. Этаж над плитой поделён на две части": "<figure class='st'><svg viewBox='0 0 400 276' width='100%' role='img' aria-label='Плита ACDH и этаж над ней: квадрат GHIJ слева, прямоугольник DEJI справа'><rect x='60' y='144' width='200' height='56' fill='none' stroke='#cfdae6' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='60' y='72' width='200' height='72' fill='none' stroke='#cfdae6' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='132' y1='72' x2='132' y2='144' stroke='#cfdae6' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><rect x='132' y='72' width='128' height='72' fill='#f0a83c' fill-opacity='.12' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='2'/><g fill='#e8eef6' font-size='13.5' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor='middle'><text x='50' y='66'>G</text><text x='126' y='64'>J</text><text x='268' y='66'>E</text><text x='48' y='152'>H</text><text x='140' y='160'>I</text><text x='270' y='152'>D</text><text x='48' y='212'>A</text><text x='270' y='212'>C</text></g><g fill='#f0a83c' font-size='13.5' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor='middle'><text x='96' y='113'>s</text><text x='196' y='113'>c − s</text></g><g stroke='#93a1b1' stroke-width='1'><line x1='286' y1='72' x2='286' y2='144'/><line x1='281' y1='72' x2='291' y2='72'/><line x1='281' y1='144' x2='291' y2='144'/><line x1='60' y1='222' x2='260' y2='222'/><line x1='60' y1='217' x2='60' y2='227'/><line x1='260' y1='217' x2='260' y2='227'/></g><text x='300' y='113' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='13.5' font-family='sans-serif'>s</text><text x='160' y='240' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='13.5' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor='middle'>c = AC</text><text x='200' y='266' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='14' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor='middle'>полупериметр DEJI = (c − s) + s = c</text></svg><figcaption>Квадрат стоит на том же этаже, поэтому его сторона задаёт и высоту соседа: в полупериметре она вычитается и тут же прибавляется.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Прямоугольник MPQU разрезан на 2 равных A": "<figure class='st'><svg viewBox='-30 -22 180 116' role='img' aria-label='Прямоугольник MPQU, разрезанный на две A, три B, квадрат C и четыре треугольника D'><path stroke='#cfdae6' stroke-width='1.1' fill='none' d='M0 0H132V72H0Z'/><rect x='0' y='30' width='24' height='42' fill='#f0a83c' fill-opacity='.13' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='0.7'/><rect x='24' y='30' width='24' height='42' fill='#f0a83c' fill-opacity='.13' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='0.7'/><rect x='48' y='30' width='24' height='42' fill='#f0a83c' fill-opacity='.13' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='0.7'/><rect x='0' y='0' width='42' height='15' fill='#5ba8f5' fill-opacity='.13' stroke='#5ba8f5' stroke-width='0.7'/><rect x='0' y='15' width='42' height='15' fill='#5ba8f5' fill-opacity='.13' stroke='#5ba8f5' stroke-width='0.7'/><rect x='42' y='0' width='30' height='30' fill='#5fd38d' fill-opacity='.13' stroke='#5fd38d' stroke-width='0.7'/><polygon points='72,0 72,72 102,0' fill='#a98cf0' fill-opacity='.13' stroke='#a98cf0' stroke-width='0.7'/><polygon points='72,72 102,72 102,0' fill='#a98cf0' fill-opacity='.13' stroke='#a98cf0' stroke-width='0.7'/><polygon points='102,72 132,72 102,0' fill='#a98cf0' fill-opacity='.13' stroke='#a98cf0' stroke-width='0.7'/><polygon points='102,0 132,72 132,0' fill='#a98cf0' fill-opacity='.13' stroke='#a98cf0' stroke-width='0.7'/><path stroke='#cfdae6' stroke-width='1' fill='none' d='M72 0V72'/><text x='12' y='54' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='5.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>B</text><text x='36' y='54' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='5.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>B</text><text x='60' y='54' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='5.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>B</text><text x='21' y='9.6' fill='#5ba8f5' font-size='5.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>A</text><text x='21' y='24.6' fill='#5ba8f5' font-size='5.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>A</text><text x='57' y='18' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='5.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>C</text><text x='57' y='25.5' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='3.4' text-anchor='middle'>квадрат</text><text x='82' y='27' fill='#a98cf0' font-size='5.2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>D</text><text x='92' y='51' fill='#a98cf0' font-size='5.2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>D</text><text x='112' y='51' fill='#a98cf0' font-size='5.2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>D</text><text x='122' y='27' fill='#a98cf0' font-size='5.2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>D</text><text x='36' y='-11' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle'>MNSU — квадрат</text><g><text x='-4.5' y='-3' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>U</text><text x='42' y='-3' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>T</text><text x='72' y='-3' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>S</text><text x='102' y='-3' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>R</text><text x='136.5' y='-3' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>Q</text><text x='-4.5' y='31.5' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>V</text><text x='67' y='37.5' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>Z</text><text x='38' y='37.5' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>X</text><text x='-4.5' y='79' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>M</text><text x='72' y='79.5' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>N</text><text x='136.5' y='79' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>P</text></g><g fill='none' stroke='#93a1b1' stroke-width='.6'><path fill='none' d='M0 83.8V88.2M0 86H132M132 83.8V88.2'/><path fill='none' d='M-22.2 0H-17.8M-20 0V72M-22.2 72H-17.8'/><path fill='none' d='M-12.2 30H-7.8M-10 30V72M-12.2 72H-7.8'/><path fill='none' d='M0 -18.2V-13.8M0 -16H42M42 -18.2V-13.8'/><path fill='none' d='M72 -18.2V-13.8M72 -16H102M102 -18.2V-13.8'/></g><text x='66' y='92.5' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='5' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>w</text><text x='-25' y='38' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='5' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>x</text><text x='-15' y='55' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='5' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>v</text><text x='21' y='-18.5' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='5' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>t</text><text x='87' y='-18.5' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='5' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>g</text><text x='80' y='44' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='5' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>d</text><text x='123' y='44' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='5' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>d</text></svg><figcaption>Вертикаль N→S отрезает квадрат MNSU, горизонталь V→Z — ряд из трёх B, вертикаль T→X делит верх на блок A и квадрат C, а точка R с вертикалью и двумя косыми режет правую часть на четыре равных D. Буквы-кирпичики: <b>w</b> = MP, <b>x</b> = сторона MNSU, <b>v</b> = высота ряда B, <b>t</b> = ширина A, <b>g</b> = SR, <b>d</b> = косая NR = RP.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Заметь главное. Оба квадрата работают здесь не как фигуры": "<figure class='st fx'><svg class='narrow' viewBox='-40 -26 152 162' role='img' aria-label='Квадрат MNSU: почему t равно v и почему прямоугольник TUVX даёт сторону x'><path fill='none' stroke='#8b98a8' stroke-width='.9' d='M0 0H72V72H0Z'/><path fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='.6' d='M0 30H72M42 0V30M0 15H42M24 30V72M48 30V72'/><text x='-4.5' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>U</text><text x='42' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>T</text><text x='-4.5' y='31.5' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>V</text><text x='38' y='37.5' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>X</text><text x='-4.5' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>M</text><text x='77' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>S</text><text x='67' y='37.5' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>Z</text><text x='77' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>N</text><g class='fi' style='--d:.4s'><rect x='42' y='0' width='30' height='30' fill='#5fd38d' fill-opacity='.16' stroke='#5fd38d' stroke-width='1'/><text x='57' y='18' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='5.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>C</text><g fill='none' stroke='#5fd38d' stroke-width='.6'><path fill='none' d='M42 -10.2V-5.8M42 -8H72M72 -10.2V-5.8'/><path fill='none' d='M77.8 0H82.2M80 0V30M77.8 30H82.2'/></g><text x='57' y='-11' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='4.6' text-anchor='middle'>x − t</text><text x='90' y='17' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='4.6' text-anchor='middle'>x − v</text></g><g class='fi' style='--d:1.4s'><g fill='none' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='.7'><path fill='none' d='M0 -10.2V-5.8M0 -8H42M42 -10.2V-5.8'/><path fill='none' d='M-11.2 30H-6.8M-9 30V72M-11.2 72H-6.8'/></g><text x='21' y='-11' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='5.2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>t</text><text x='-15' y='55' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='5.2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>v</text></g><text class='fi' style='--d:2.2s' x='36' y='100' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='5' text-anchor='middle'>у квадрата C стороны равны:  x − t = x − v,  значит  t = v</text><g class='fi' style='--d:3.0s'><rect x='0' y='0' width='42' height='30' fill='#f0a83c' fill-opacity='.10' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.2'/><g fill='none' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='.7'><path fill='none' d='M-11.2 0H-6.8M-9 0V30M-11.2 30H-6.8'/></g><text x='-17' y='17' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='4.6' text-anchor='middle'>x − v</text><text x='21' y='17' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='4.6' text-anchor='middle'>TUVX</text></g><path class='sl' style='--d:3.8s;--to:translate(0px,30px) rotate(90deg)' fill='none' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='2.2' stroke-linecap='round' d='M0 0H42'/><g class='fi' style='--d:5.2s'><g fill='none' stroke='#e8eef6' stroke-width='.7'><path fill='none' d='M-26.2 0H-21.8M-24 0V72M-26.2 72H-21.8'/></g><text x='-30' y='38' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='5.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>x</text></g><text class='fi' style='--d:5.6s' x='36' y='116' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='5.4' text-anchor='middle'>t + (x − v)  =  v + (x − v)  =  x</text><text class='fi' style='--d:6.2s' x='36' y='132' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='5.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>P(TUVX) = 144 = 2x   →   x = 72</text></svg><figcaption>Квадрат C стоит между рядом B и блоком A, поэтому его ширина x − t и высота x − v — это одно и то же число, и t = v. А тогда верхняя сторона TUVX (это t) переезжает на левый бок и вместе с боковой стороной x − v достраивает целую сторону квадрата: полупериметр TUVX равен x.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Прямоугольник TUVX сообщает сторону большого квадрата": "<figure class='st fx'><div class='fgrid2'><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-28 -18 190 108' role='img' aria-label='Контур TUVX'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.9' d='M0 0H132V72H0Z'/><g fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.7'><path d='M72 0V72M0 30H72M42 0V30M0 15H42M24 30V72M48 30V72M102 0V72M72 72L102 0M102 0L132 72'/></g><text x='-4.5' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>U</text><text x='72' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>S</text><text x='102' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>R</text><text x='136.5' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>Q</text><text x='-4.5' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>M</text><text x='72' y='79.5' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>N</text><text x='136.5' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>P</text><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2.2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='2.4' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M42 0L0 0L0 30L42 30Z'/><text class='fi' style='--d:0.9s' x='21' y='-5' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>t</text><text class='fi' style='--d:1.6s' x='-14' y='17' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>x − v</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(TUVX) = 144</b> → t + (x − v) + t + (x − v) = 144</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-28 -18 190 108' role='img' aria-label='Контур MNZV'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.9' d='M0 0H132V72H0Z'/><g fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.7'><path d='M72 0V72M0 30H72M42 0V30M0 15H42M24 30V72M48 30V72M102 0V72M72 72L102 0M102 0L132 72'/></g><text x='-4.5' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>U</text><text x='72' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>S</text><text x='102' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>R</text><text x='136.5' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>Q</text><text x='67' y='37.5' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>Z</text><text x='-4.5' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>M</text><text x='72' y='79.5' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>N</text><text x='136.5' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>P</text><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2.2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='2.4' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M0 72L72 72L72 30L0 30Z'/><text class='fi' style='--d:0.9s' x='36' y='80' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>x</text><text class='fi' style='--d:1.6s' x='-11' y='55' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>v</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(MNZV) = 228</b> → x + v + x + v = 228</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-28 -18 190 108' role='img' aria-label='Контур MNRU'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.9' d='M0 0H132V72H0Z'/><g fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.7'><path d='M72 0V72M0 30H72M42 0V30M0 15H42M24 30V72M48 30V72M102 0V72M72 72L102 0M102 0L132 72'/></g><text x='-4.5' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>U</text><text x='72' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>S</text><text x='102' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>R</text><text x='136.5' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>Q</text><text x='-4.5' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>M</text><text x='72' y='79.5' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>N</text><text x='136.5' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>P</text><circle cx='72' cy='0' r='2.6' fill='#f2686c'/><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2.2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='2.4' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M0 72L72 72L102 0L0 0Z'/><text class='fi' style='--d:0.9s' x='36' y='80' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>x</text><text class='fi' style='--d:1.6s' x='96' y='45' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>d</text><text class='fi' style='--d:2.3s' x='50' y='-6' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>g + x</text><text class='fi' style='--d:2.8s' x='-13' y='40' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>x</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(MNRU) = 324</b> → x + d + (g + x) + x = 324  ⚠ сторона R→U идёт <b>через S</b></p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-28 -18 190 108' role='img' aria-label='Контур NPQR'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.9' d='M0 0H132V72H0Z'/><g fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.7'><path d='M72 0V72M0 30H72M42 0V30M0 15H42M24 30V72M48 30V72M102 0V72M72 72L102 0M102 0L132 72'/></g><text x='-4.5' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>U</text><text x='72' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>S</text><text x='102' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>R</text><text x='136.5' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>Q</text><text x='-4.5' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>M</text><text x='72' y='79.5' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>N</text><text x='136.5' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>P</text><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2.2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='2.4' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M72 72L132 72L132 0L102 0Z'/><text class='fi' style='--d:0.9s' x='102' y='80' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>w − x</text><text class='fi' style='--d:1.6s' x='140' y='40' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>x</text><text class='fi' style='--d:2.2s' x='117' y='-6' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>g</text><text class='fi' style='--d:2.7s' x='95' y='45' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>d</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(NPQR) = 240</b> → (w − x) + x + g + d = 240</p></div></div><figcaption>Четыре данных периметра — четыре обхода по этой же фигуре. Каждый обход даёт одну строчку системы; красная точка на третьем контуре — та самая S, мимо которой сторона R→U проходит насквозь.</figcaption></figure>",
