r='middle'>24 × 42</text><text x='21' y='8' fill='#5ba8f5' font-size='4.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>A</text><text x='21' y='12.6' fill='#5ba8f5' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle'>42 × 15</text><text x='21' y='23' fill='#5ba8f5' font-size='4.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>A</text><text x='21' y='27.6' fill='#5ba8f5' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle'>42 × 15</text><text x='57' y='15' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='5' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>C</text><text x='57' y='21' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='4' text-anchor='middle'>30 × 30</text><text x='82' y='26' fill='#a98cf0' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>D</text><text x='92' y='50' fill='#a98cf0' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>D</text><text x='112' y='50' fill='#a98cf0' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>D</text><text x='122' y='26' fill='#a98cf0' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>D</text><text x='87' y='-4' fill='#a98cf0' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle'>30</text><text x='117' y='-4' fill='#a98cf0' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle'>30</text><text x='106.5' y='40' fill='#a98cf0' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='start'>72</text><text x='80' y='44' fill='#a98cf0' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle'>78</text><g fill='none' stroke='#93a1b1' stroke-width='.6'><path fill='none' d='M0 81.8V86.2M0 84H132M132 81.8V86.2'/><path fill='none' d='M-18.2 0H-13.8M-16 0V72M-18.2 72H-13.8'/></g><text x='66' y='90' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='5' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>w = 132</text><text x='-21' y='38' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='5' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>x</text><text x='-21' y='45' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle'>72</text><text x='-4.5' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>U</text><text x='72' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>S</text><text x='102' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>R</text><text x='136.5' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>Q</text><text x='-4.5' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>M</text><text x='72' y='79.5' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>N</text><text x='136.5' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>P</text></svg><figcaption>Все детали в числах. Треугольник D — 30-72-78, то есть 6·(5-12-13): честный прямоугольный.</figcaption></figure>",
